  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 73a7d02ab0b687141ace821fbe204419, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The school. I covered a colleague too. Thirty-four children, one room.
    midDaysAnswer: The school. Officially closed. Someone must manage the materials. So I do.
    finalDaysAnswer: The Lenin street shelter. I bring lessons. One student still does the work.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The kolkhoz office. I keep their accounts. I left teaching years ago.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: My daughter's kindergarten. Little Nana is four. I collect her daily.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: The evacuation shelter. My daughters live there now. Safer than the fourth floor.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Tired. Always tired. It means I am working. Nothing else to note.
    midDaysAnswer: A headache for days. The air, I assume. No polyclinic needed.
    finalDaysAnswer: I sleep less. I have things to think about. Normal for a mother.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: None. In five years of teaching I have never once been tired.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: No headaches. Nobody waits for me at home, so I rest plenty.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: I sleep well, thank you. At sixty one needs less. No complaints.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - Your filing system here is inconsistent. I can see it from here.
    - The officer before you was faster. Not a criticism. An observation.
    midDays:
    - Twenty-two years teaching. Lines do not bother me. Children bother me.
    - This procedure gets slower daily. I hope someone is taking notes.
    finalDays:
    - My daughters ask if I am afraid. I tell them I am managing.
    - This checkpoint will be unnecessary in a few weeks. One way or another.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
